{'symbol': 'DUK', 'date': '2023-02-17 11:00:00', 'title': 'DUKE ENERGY HELPED OVER 189,000 CUSTOMERS ACCESS MORE THAN $191 MILLION IN ENERGY ASSISTANCE', 'text': 'OVER $75 MILLION DISTRIBUTED TO 77,000 CUSTOMERS IN NORTH CAROLINA COLLABORATION KEY TO SUCCESS IN ASSISTING CUSTOMERS IN NEED CHARLOTTE, N.C. , FEB. 17, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AS RISING PRICES FOR MANY GOODS AND SERVICES HIT FAMILIES AND BUSINESSES ACROSS ITS TERRITORY OVER THE LAST YEAR, DUKE ENERGY HELPED NEARLY 190,000 RESIDENTIAL CUSTOMERS GAIN ACCESS TO NEARLY $200 MILLION IN FUNDS TO HELP PAY THEIR ENERGY BILLS IN 2022.'}